 rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味描述：花香、橙子、\n          <span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           杏桃、\n          </span>\n          绿茶感\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Floral, Orange, Apricot, Green tea-like\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q5IrVl78oENAPK6XaF2KkEYDCbUKLAGggkk0JXgzQYgdTDI3lcrFDmdf4cFRgwgJjB9uXROmyHMA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 578px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于El Retiro 歌赛亚\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1832年，弗朗西斯科·阿尔布雷斯（Francisco Alburez）买下歌赛亚庄园(El Retiro del Quisaya)，之后庄园一直为阿尔布雷斯家族所有。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RA4rDkgUicLTmo2wfaicM1iahibFoobL92dMXb4jD9ZsiaZ6RFEiaJPxgfaloQ07gwTSRHIW1oic2otHnmA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          随后，弗朗西斯科·阿尔布雷斯女儿玛丽亚·阿尔布雷斯·德·奥尔特加继承了庄园，她是一个非常勤劳的女人，在她管理庄园期间，农场的主要产品是玉米和黑豆。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          之后，农场被继承给了他们的儿子卡洛斯·奥尔特加·阿尔布雷斯。卡洛斯从16岁开始管理农场。他是一个非常有远见的人，一直都在寻找改善生活的想法，所以他在1912年种植了第一批咖啡树。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RA4rDkgUicLTmo2wfaicM1iahKf5FmYbps9fakwkIr9UrgZdPvC6yQl2ibruiboZyM5yF2MHT3gibFS8og/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          随着1976年的地震，圣马丁·希洛特佩克市发生山体滑坡，将这里和外界隔离，导致该地区无法与外界联系。农场的主屋和教堂都倒塌了。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1981年后，由于家族内部原因，卡洛斯和他的妻子巴尔比娜不得不放弃农场。此后便是第四代人从1996年开始管理现在的农场。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RA4rDkgUicLTmo2wfaicM1iahibRMfscZj35lQnS4FYOj7W3qr7U7h6dNIQLrJiaLw1eHbT1wTycR2JIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n          现在庄园的管理执行由\n          <span style='color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 12px;font-family: \"Archer Light\", sans-seif;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           Fernando Diaz和女儿\n           <span style='color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 12px;font-family: \"Archer Light\", sans-seif;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n            Marcela负责\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这一家族的咖啡种植代代相传，直到今天，卡洛斯和巴尔比纳的子孙都致力于保持这一传统。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);white-space: normal;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 388px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
